  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ma&apos;an,  Community Resilience  in Jordan Valley</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support vulnerable and marginalized communities in Jordan Valley through integrated and multisectoral interventions to help them maintain essential services amidst the increasing restrictions and marginalization, mainly due to the settlements&apos; activities. The project strengthens and supports the development of female-led businesses through grant interventions, marketing support, and administrative improvements.</narrative>
  </description>
